WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:14.120
A flow is an automatic, step-by-step conversation: a trigger, like the word price, a comment or an ad, then messages, buttons, questions and actions on a visual canvas.

2
00:00:14.666 --> 00:00:24.300
The quickest way: click New flow, gallery. Search the gallery, and watch the Preview. It runs on a test customer, and sends nothing.

3
00:00:24.848 --> 00:00:31.190
Use now adds the flow. If something is missing, it stays a draft until you complete it.

4
00:00:31.739 --> 00:00:41.370
To build or edit, put a trigger on the canvas first, then add the next step with plus on any output. Click a step to open its settings.

5
00:00:41.922 --> 00:00:49.460
Test runs the flow in the simulator. When it is right, click Publish. Each publish is a new version.

6
00:00:50.014 --> 00:00:57.170
The switch beside each flow turns it on or off. And steps that no trigger reaches never run.
